                    {'title': 'Excel Mortgage Tracker', 'description': 'I need an Excel spreadsheet to manage mortgage offer expiration dates for my clients. \n\nRequirements:\n- Use of formulas for date order.\n- Sorting clients by expiration date.\n\nIdeal Skills:\n- Proficiency in Excel, especially with formulas.\n- Experience in creating organized and functional spreadsheets.', 'price': '20 - 250 GBP', 'time': '4 minutes ago', 'platform': 'Freelancer', 'category': 'برمجة، تطوير المواقع والتطبيقات', 'project_link': 'https: //www.freelancer.com/projects/excel-macros/Excel-Mortgage-Tracker', 'offer_count': '25', 'project_status': 'open', 'duration': '7 days', 'skills': ['visual basic', 'data processing', 'data entry', 'excel', 'excel vba', 'excel macros', 'data analysis', 'data management'], 'uid': 'freelancer:40684670', 'country': 'UN', 'language': 'en', 'tags': ['Visual Basic', 'Data Processing', 'Data Entry', 'Excel', 'Excel VBA', 'Excel Macros', 'Data Analysis', 'Data Management']}, {'title': 'Nutrition Blog Articles Needed', 'description': 'I run a health-and-wellness blog centred on Nutrition and Diet and I need a skilled writer who can craft clear, evidence-based articles in a professional, informative voice. Each post should translate the latest research into practical advice my readers can act on right away—think balanced-meal breakdowns, myth-busting explainers, and step-by-step guides that make healthy eating approachable without oversimplifying the science.\n\nHere’s how I see the workflow:\n\n• Topics: I will share a working list or headlines; you’re welcome to propose fresh angles that stay within the Nutrition and Diet niche.  \n• Length: 1,000–1,500 words per article, long enough to cover the subject thoroughly while remaining engaging.  \n• Tone & structure: Professional, data-driven and reader-friendly. Cite reputable sources (peer-reviewed studies, government guidelines) and include links.  \n• SEO: Naturally weave in primary keywords I provide, 