category': 'برمجة، تطوير المواقع والتطبيقات', 'project_link': 'https://www.freelancer.com/projects/web-design/Modern-Lifestyle-Blog-Website', 'offer_count': '313', 'project_status': 'open', 'duration': '7 days', 'skills': ['php', 'website design', 'graphic design', 'cms', 'html', 'web development', 'web design', 'website development'], 'uid': 'freelancer:40684652', 'country': 'UN', 'language': 'en', 'tags': ['PHP', 'Website Design', 'Graphic Design', 'CMS', 'HTML', 'Web Development', 'Web Design', 'Website Development']}, {'title': '2D Drawings to 3D Assemblies', 'description': 'I will provide you with a full set of DXF / PDF technical drawings and need them rebuilt as faithful, manufacturing-ready 3D models. The end use is production, so dimensional accuracy and clean feature trees are essential.  \n\nI work in SolidWorks, so please create the master assembly and all component files there, then export a consolidated STEP assembly plus individual STEP files for every part. If you generate native files in another package as well, include those too.\n\nBefore work begins I’ll send the drawings for your review; after that, let me know:\n\n• a single all-inclusive price  \n• your turnaround time  \n• confirmation that you will model in SolidWorks  \n• two or three examples of past 2D-to-3D conversions you have handled for manufacturing  \n\nDeliverables will be considered complete when:\n\n1. Every part matches the supplied 2D geometry within accepted machining tolerances.  \n2. The full assembly opens in SolidWorks without errors and reflects correct mates and BOM structure.  \n3. STEP exports load cleanly in neutral viewers.  \n\nIf this aligns with your skills, I’m ready to get the drawings to you right away.', 'price': '600 - 1500 INR', 'time': '12 minutes ago', 'platform': 'Freelancer', 'category': 'برمجة، تطوير المواقع والتطبيقات', 'project_link': 'https://www.freelancer.com/projects/3d-design/Drawings-Assemblies', 'offer_count': '2', 'project_status': 'open', 'duration': '7 days', 'skills': ['cad/cam', '3d rendering', 'solidworks', '3d modelling', '3d design', '2d drawing', '2d drafting', '3d cad'], 'uid': 'freelancer:40684651', 'country': 'UN', 'language': 'en', 'tags': ['CAD/CAM', '3D Rendering', 'Solidworks', '3D Modelling', '3D Design', '2D Drawing', '2D Drafting', '3D CAD']}, {'title': 'Digital Product WordPress Store', 'description': 'I want to launch an e-commerce site built on WordPress that sells only digital products. After checkout, customers must receive an automatic, secure download link—no physical shipping steps at any point. WooCommerce (or another proven digital-commerce plugin) should power the cart, payment gateway connections, and licence or file-access rules. \n\nDesign-wise, the theme needs to feel clean and creative, with space for eye-catching screenshots and concise product copy. Think fast-loading pages, intuitive navigation, and a fully responsive layout so buyers on mobile can purchase and download just as easily as desktop users.  \n\nCore set-up tasks include:\n• Installing and configuring WordPress and the chosen e-commerce plugin for “Downloadable products”  \n• Connecting Stripe and PayPal (plus any free payment methods you recommend)  \n• Creating a template product page I can duplicate for future items  \n• Setting secure file storage paths, expiring links, and automated customer emails  \n• Testing the full purchase-to-download flow end-to-end  \n\nPlease keep the back-end organised and document any custom code or add-ons so I can extend the store later—membership tiers or subscription plans may be added down the road, so flexibility is appreciated.', 'price': '12500 - 37500 INR', 'time': '14 minutes ago', 'platform': 'Freelancer', 'category': 'برمجة، تطوير المواقع والتطبيقات', 'project_link': 'https://www.freelancer.com/projects/css/Digital-Product-WordPress-Store', 'offer_count': '48', 'project_status': 'open', 'duration': '7 days', 'skills': ['javascript', 'css', 'ecommerce', 'html', '